# STEP PREFIXES: "Nelim's Sanctuary:" is the Sanctuary Backlot (fixture and named places); "Nelim's Pickle Tools:" is PickleTools
# (ScreenshotStudio presentation mode, ColonistRace clothes and forced jobs, CameraZoom, InspectTabs, ScreenshotMode); the rest is Pickle's.
#
# THE SERIES (GALLERY.md: staged photographs except the menus; one story; the session directs it). Recomposed 2026-11-10 after the
# red runs p17 and p18 and the director's pass of an Opus sub-agent (moas 5 px wide in 1, back views and no hay in 2, no chick in 4).
# NB: in this tool a SMALLER zoom number frames TIGHTER (zoom 8.5 gave moas about 50 px, zoom 4 about 120 px, zoom 2.4 about 220 px).
# Protagonist: Nelim (Virginie), canon looks of SanctuaryBacklot/docs/APPARENCES-CANON.md: high ponytail (`Roo_HD_Hair_Highpony`,
# never a bun), her own face, a bright smile (MouthSmile, LidCheerful: smiling is the default on a default scene, GALLERY.md 2026-10-25).
# Outfit, the same all day (continuity, criterion d): cream shirt (238, 228, 205) and forest-green trousers (46, 94, 66), chosen so
# the blue-grey moas stand out against her. Only NSB colonists: Nelim alone. Animals: the moa (added by the mod, authorized by default);
# the emu of image 5 is outside NSB and waits for the owner's validation (fallback: Shogun, the labrador of NSB, same beat).
#
# THE STORY, "a day with the flock", noon at the pen `enclosure-south`, clear, 20 degrees. Rhythm: one start hour (12) and a
# cumulative wait: 60 ticks of set-up, then +208 ticks (5 game minutes) per image, so 12:01, 12:06, 12:11, 12:16, 12:21
# (60, 268, 477, 685, 893 ticks). (1) Nelim comes in through the south gate with an armful of hay and the flock gathers around her;
# (2) she has put the hay down, three moas eat it and look at us, and she walks off smiling; (3) a hen broods three eggs on a big nest
# bed while a male crosses behind her; (4) a chick and its mother eat side by side; (5) a neighbour (the emu, or Shogun) arrives at the
# same hay as a moa, and Nelim leaves through the gate; (6) the information card of the moa closes the series (eggs and meat yields).
# Mod brought in for the story: More animal beds (Animal.BedsNew, GSAnimalBedBigPrestige, the nest; GALLERY-PROPS.md).
# Hay (vanilla `Hay`) is what Nelim carries and sets down; every heap, lamp and plant is decor, removed after the shot.
#
# HOW A GESTURE IS OBTAINED: the game is paused; a pawn or an animal is forced into a job (Ingest on a Hay heap, a walk, a lie-down),
# then `I advance the paused game by exactly N ticks` lets the job begin and stops it mid-movement. N is a first guess (about
# 13 ticks per cell for a walking pawn) and is tuned by the capture, never by the run being green.
# FACING (corrected 2026-11-10): a forced Ingest on a heap SOUTH of a moa gave back views in p18. A moa that has to look at us is set with
# `the animal X stands at (x, z) facing South` and is NOT given a job; only one bird per shot is forced into Ingest (the gesture).
#
# SHOOTING PLAN (place; moment; subject; composition; living things; decor; the instant; what the image says):
#   1. WIDE-MEDIUM opening. enclosure-south; 12:01; Nelim and the flock; zoom 3 on (155, 211), the south gate at x 159, z 207, its fence and
#        a lit TorchLamp at (160, 208) in frame; Nelim mid-stride just inside the gate, 20 Hay in her hands (forced to walk from (158, 208)
#        to (155, 210), 25 ticks), smiling; four adult moas bunched around her: Kiwi (152, 213) and Pip (154, 213) stand facing South
#        (front views), Dune and Moss (150, 212) and (156, 213) forced into Ingest on a Hay heap at (153, 211), 25 ticks; decor: Hay heap
#        (153, 211), Plant_YellowTallGrass (147, 214), (150, 216), (161, 212), Plant_Daylily (156, 208), (157, 208), (158, 208);
#        instant: "just after she steps through the gate with the first armful"; says "a flock of big birds gathers around Nelim and her hay".
#   2. MEDIUM. enclosure-south; +5 min; zoom 3 on (149, 213); three moas staggered, not in a row: Kiwi (147, 214) and Dune (151, 214)
#        stand facing South, Pip (149, 215) is forced into Ingest on a full heap (75 Hay) at (149, 214), head going down; two more heaps
#        at (147, 213) and (151, 213) in front of the others; Nelim at (153, 212) forced to walk south to (153, 209), smiling, mid-step, her
#        face towards us; decor: lit Brazier (145, 215), tall grass along z 216, Plant_Daylily (152, 215); instant: "just after she set the
#        hay down, the first beak goes down"; says "they gather and eat".
#   3. CLOSE. enclosure-south; +10 min; zoom 2.4 on (149, 214); a hen lies on a big animal bed nest (GSAnimalBedBigPrestige at
#        (148, 214)) with three fertilized eggs (EggMoaFertilized, now accepted on the bed by StageDecor, PiT 2026-11-10) and tall yellow
#        grass around, a lit TorchLamp at (151, 214), facing South; a cock mid-stride at the edge of the frame, forced into Ingest on a heap at (145, 216), 25 ticks;
#        instant: "just before the cock reaches the hay beside the nest"; says "they lay big eggs and brood them".
#   4. CLOSE. enclosure-south; +15 min; zoom 2.2 on (148, 214); the hen Pip eats from a heap at (147, 214) right beside her at
#        (147, 215); the chick (life stage 0) is spawned INSIDE the frame at (149, 214), one cell from its own heap at (148, 213), forced
#        into Ingest, 8 ticks, in front of its mother so she does not cover it; no nest, no egg; decor: tall grass (146, 216), (150, 216),
#        Plant_Daylily (145, 213), a lit TorchLamp at (151, 215), the fence edge; instant: "just before the chick reaches the heap beside its mother"; says "the chicks
#        follow the flock".
#   5. MEDIUM closing (emu validated by the owner on 2026-11-10: "valide"). enclosure-south; +20 min; zoom 4 on (150, 212): a hen moa and a
#        cock emu meet at a Hay heap, face to face in profile; Nelim in the background leaving through the south gate, empty-handed, back
#        mostly to us, mid-step, the same outfit; a lit TorchLamp at (160, 208) and Plant_Daylily (156, 208) at the gate; instant: "just as the emu reaches the moa's heap"; says "the emu neighbour comes to the same hay as the moa";
#        (hen moa x cock emu breed: Better Crossbreeding). Fallback without the emu: zoom 4 on x 153, z 210, Shogun walking west from x 154, z 212
#        towards the hen at x 149, z 212, Nelim leaving through the gate at x 159, z 207, TorchLamp and Daylily at the gate.
#   6. INTERFACE. the information card of the moa (Stats tab, eggs and meat yields) on `window-backdrop-for-height`, cropped
#        around the window afterwards, no subtitle (not rated).
#
# SHOTLIST SCORE (GALLERY.md k, per shot a to g and j): see STATUS.md, "Shotlist 2026-11-10".
# Review scenario: asserts each capture was taken, not what is on it. Each capture has to be OPENED AND LOOKED AT (AUDIT.md 9.d).
#
#   -Language English -DepMap wsl-deps.gallery.map -Filter '11-gallery-captures'
